SUMMARY:Everwalk Liberty State Park Loop Walk (joint walk with Freewalkers
 )
DESCRIPTION:EverWalk NJ\nThis is a 7-mile walk through Liberty State Park 
 with great view of the New York skyline\, the Statue of Liberty\, and bird
 s in tidal flats.\n\n**You can only register for this event on Eventbrite 
 at:**\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/liberty-state-park-loop-walk-tickets-1
 992790907248?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nThis is one of the monthly Everwalk walk
 s occurring across the country and around the world . More information can
  be found at www.EverWalk.com and on the EverWalk Facebook page: https://w
 ww.facebook.com/groups/EverWalkNation/.\n\nMeet in front of the Empty Sky 
 Memorial (facing the parking lot).\n\nParking directions are available at 
 the Eventbrite link.
